WEBVTT

NOTE
The Love Corner Bible Adventures: Jonah and the Great Fish. The caption script
for the animated episode (DR-1523, J4). The cue TEXT is final: each verse is the
KJV word for word from the in-repo text (generated, never typed), each guide line
